 begin="00:45.430" end="00:46.930">Hoo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.830" end="00:47.510">Munda sab mein sab ton best</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.510" end="00:49.300">Munda better than the rest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.300" end="00:51.450">Ennu vekhe ke munde toh kehnde</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.450" end="00:52.950">Oh my god</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.720" end="00:56.260" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.260" end="00:58.130">Oh seena 6 biscut da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.130" end="00:59.830">Oh munda 6 foot da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.830" end="01:03.320">Oh dheere dheere karda dhamaal sa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.320" end="01:04.820" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.590" end="01:07.020">Oh munda kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.020" end="01:08.520" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.030" end="01:10.710">Oh munda kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.710" end="01:12.210" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.510" end="01:14.090">Oh kudiya te ho jaayegi effect</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.090" end="01:17.240">Oh di chaal da kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.240" end="01:18.740" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.040" end="01:21.020">Oh munda kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.020" end="01:22.520" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.780" end="01:25.430">Oh munda kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.430" end="01:29.170">Oh bando mein banda perfect bemisaal sa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.170" end="01:32.830">Kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.830" end="01:35.530">Koi naa jaane kittho aaye hai tu</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.530" end="01:37.030" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.090" end="01:39.620">Sab de dilon vich ho gayi kookdakoo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.620" end="01:42.840">Koi naa jaane kittho aaye hai tu</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.840" end="01:45.760">Sab de dilon vich ho gayi kookdakoo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.760" end="01:49.300">Tu te hoya hai sab di misaal sohneya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.300" end="01:50.800">Tu te</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.960" end="01:53.250">Chamke bann ankhaan vich star sohneya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.250" end="01:56.040" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.040" end="01:59.520">Ho tu te lagg bada hi tip top beliya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.520" end="02:03.170">Tu te aaye pe dooje full stop beliya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.170" end="02:04.950">Dil daude ittar uttar</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.950" end="02:06.650">Dhadkan vi tittar bittar</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.650" end="02:10.320">Ho munda angdaayi jado maar da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.320" end="02:11.820">Maar da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.400" end="02:13.860">Oh munda kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.860" end="02:15.360" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.790" end="02:17.680">Oh munda kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.680" end="02:19.180" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.530" end="02:20.860">Oh kudiya te ho jaayegi effect</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.860" end="02:24.270">Oh di chaal da kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.270" end="02:25.770" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.130" end="02:28.050">Oh munda kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.050" end="02:29.550" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.610" end="02:32.310">Oh munda kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.310" end="02:34.110">Oh bando mein banda</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.110" end="02:36.000">Perfect bemisaal sa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.000" end="02:38.740">Kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.740" end="02:40.240" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.410" end="02:40.910">Hey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.980" end="02:42.850" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.850" end="02:44.350">Hey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.350" end="02:46.340" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.340" end="02:47.840">Hey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.830" end="02:49.810" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.810" end="02:51.310">Hey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.300" end="02:53.190" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.190" end="02:54.810">Where he's where he's from from</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.810" end="02:56.340">Whose that whose that guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.340" end="02:58.040">He something very special</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.040" end="02:59.690">I don't know what I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.690" end="03:01.530">He's really got me going</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.530" end="03:03.460">He makes me feel alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.460" end="03:05.110">Baby baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.110" end="03:07.100">He can get lucky tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.100" end="03:08.600">I like the way he's lookin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.600" end="03:10.320">Hey the way he is moving now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.320" end="03:12.040">Hey I like the way they call him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.040" end="03:13.670">Kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.670" end="03:15.520">Hey I like the way he's walkin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.520" end="03:17.120">Hey the way he's talkin' now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.120" end="03:18.940">Hey I like the way they call him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.940" end="03:20.440">Kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.080" end="03:21.580">Hey main keha</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.720" end="03:24.160">Khadeya kyun sab nu bukhaar bewajah hai kyun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.160" end="03:27.600">Ik anaar sau bimaar bewajah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:27.600" end="03:30.420" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:30.420" end="03:31.920">Oh le le</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.060" end="03:33.790">Do din di chandni udhaar mundeya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:33.790" end="03:36.000">Tu te rehna hai aithe din</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:36.000" end="03:37.500">Chaar mundeya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:37.400" end="03:39.230">Tu kar lai jinni binti</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:39.230" end="03:40.920">Honi naa teri ginti</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:40.920" end="03:45.220">Aye tabbar hai ji dooje thekedaar daa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:45.220" end="03:46.720" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:45.810" end="03:48.070">Oh munda kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:48.070" end="03:49.570">Kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:49.120" end="03:51.380">Oh munda kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:51.380" end="03:52.930">Kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:52.930" end="03:54.800">Oh kudiya te ho jaayegi</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:54.800" end="03:56.580">Effect oh di chaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:56.580" end="03:58.340">Kukkad kamal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:58.340" end="03:59.840" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:59.390" end="04:02.780">Oh munda kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:02.780" end="04:05.520">Oh munda kukkad kamaal da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:05.520" end="04:07.020" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:06.420" end="04:09.030">Oh bando mein banda perfect</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:09.030" end="04:10.530">Bemisaal saa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:10.290" end="04:14.290">Kukkad kamaal da</p></div></body></tt>